91" end="02:23.579">fast</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.907" end="02:27.922"><span begin="02:23.907" end="02:24.163">Watching </span><span begin="02:24.163" end="02:24.371">the </span><span begin="02:24.371" end="02:24.883">leaves </span><span begin="02:25.123" end="02:25.451">fall </span><span begin="02:25.451" end="02:25.923">from </span><span begin="02:25.923" end="02:26.778">our </span><span begin="02:26.970" end="02:27.754">tree</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.922" end="02:34.401"><span begin="02:27.922" end="02:28.129">Baby </span><span begin="02:28.129" end="02:28.346">I </span><span begin="02:28.346" end="02:28.561">just </span><span begin="02:28.993" end="02:29.705">want </span><span begin="02:29.961" end="02:31.617">you </span><span begin="02:32.017" end="02:32.289">to </span><span begin="02:32.289" end="02:32.809">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.401" end="02:36.345"><span begin="02:34.401" end="02:34.689">I </span><span begin="02:34.689" end="02:34.993">still </span><span begin="02:35.169" end="02:35.417">love </span><span begin="02:35.625" end="02:36.001">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.345" end="02:37.201"><span begin="02:36.345" end="02:36.625">Love </span><span begin="02:36.625" end="02:36.929">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.201" end="02:38.137"><span begin="02:37.201" end="02:37.593">Love </span><span begin="02:37.593" end="02:37.897">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.137" end="02:39.131"><span begin="02:38.137" end="02:38.545">Love </span><span begin="02:38.545" end="02:38.961">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.131" end="02:40.084"><span begin="02:39.131" end="02:39.563">Love </span><span begin="02:39.563" end="02:39.804">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.084" end="04:24.819"><span begin="02:40.084" end="02:40.500">Love </span><span begin="02:40.500" end="02:40.707">you</span></p></div></body></tt>